MultiLingualTexts:
  - id: MLC_4Qk
    en-US: Start the belt
  - id: MLC_4hR
    en-US: Stop the belt
  - id: MLC_nZ
    en-US: Raw value of the onboard analog input, 0..27648
  - id: MLC_4JW
    en-US: Belt motor on
  - id: MLC_xa
    en-US: Belt speed in m/min
  - id: MLC_4BS
    en-US: Elapsed start delay in ms (DInt, no LInt on S7-1200)
  - id: MLC_4AL
    en-US: Start delay; TON_TIME, not TON_LTIME
  - id: MLC_4Yg
    en-US: Belt is commanded on
  - id: MLC_47c
    en-US: Nominal range of the onboard analog input
  - id: MLC_Mj
    en-US: Belt speed at full scale in m/min
